# 1️⃣ What is Partition DP?

Partition DP means:

```text
Divide Problem

Into Smaller Parts

Solve Each Part

Combine Results
```

---

### Generic Pattern

```cpp
for(k=i;k<j;k++)
{
    answer =
    min/max(
        leftPart
        +
        rightPart
    );
}
```

