# 2️⃣ Matrix Chain Multiplication (MCM)

## Problem

Given matrices:

```text
A1 A2 A3 A4
```

Find minimum multiplication cost.

---

### Example

```text
10 20 30 40
```

Meaning:

```text
10×20

20×30

30×40
```

---

# 3️⃣ State Definition

```cpp
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```text
Minimum Cost

To Multiply

Matrices i...j
```

---

# 4️⃣ Recurrence

Try every partition.

```cpp
dp[i][j]
=
min(
dp[i][k]
+
dp[k+1][j]
+
arr[i-1]
*
arr[k]
*
arr[j]
)
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(N³)

Space: O(N²)
```

---

# 5️⃣ MCM Template

```cpp
for(int k=i;k<j;k++)
{
    cost =
    solve(i,k)
    +
    solve(k+1,j)
    +
    arr[i-1]
    *
    arr[k]
    *
    arr[j];

    ans=min(ans,cost);
}
```

