# 1️⃣7️⃣ Generic Partition DP Template

```cpp
int solve(i,j)
{
    if(baseCase)
        return value;

    int ans;

    for(int k=i;k<j;k++)
    {
        ans =
        min/max(
            solve(i,k)
            +
            solve(k+1,j)
        );
    }

    return ans;
}
```

