# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ MCM is the foundation of Partition DP.

✅ Burst Balloons → Think Last Balloon.

✅ Stick Cutting → Same pattern as MCM.

✅ Boolean Parenthesization needs True/False states.

✅ Palindrome Partitioning uses string + partition DP.

